Error [E0104]: `on_commit` needs a zero-parameter lambda, got 1 parameter
  --> transact_on_commit_needs_zero_param_lambda.jet:4:22
    |
  4 |         tx.on_commit((n: Int) -> { print("{n}") })
    |                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The hook body takes no arguments — it captures what it needs via closure
 Fix: Write `<handle>.on_commit(() -> { … })` with no parameters
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0104
